      "createdAt": 1792959371992,
      "quote": "Passion is infectious. If you don't care deeply about what you're saying, why should anyone else?",
      "actionItem": "Before you speak, remind yourself why this argument matters for real people's lives and let that energy show in your eyes and voice."
